Description: Linux terminal control panel (TUI), command name wl
 Personal TUI control panel for Linux devices over SSH. Shows CPU, memory,
 network and disk charts, Docker and Caddy status cards, and AI usage.
 Includes modal settings, container stats/actions/logs, and Caddy hot reload.
